# Absolute backend origin, no trailing slash. Required in production
# (Vercel) — Vite inlines this at BUILD time, not runtime, so setting it
# requires a rebuild, not just a redeploy.
#
# Used ONLY for the OAuth login navigation (AuthContext.tsx loginWith):
# that must be an absolute top-level navigation to the backend's own
# origin so the SEC-002 CSRF cookie backend/src/auth/routers.py sets is
# scoped to the same origin the provider redirects back to. See
# backend/src/auth/routers.py module docstring and FEAT-142.
#
# Leave unset for local dev / docker-compose — vite.config.ts's dev
# proxy and the dev nginx setup share one origin across frontend and
# backend, so a relative path already works there.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://arshad-ai.onrender.com
